			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "322dbf6b-03d6-52b7-831e-ddb4c4f1607c")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: R20 (BOARD1_CLK, J6.8), R18 (BOARD1_SPI_LATCH, J6.62) and R22 (BOARD1_SPI_CLK, J6.64) hold the clock and SPI clock/latch of ASIC board 1 (port J4 side) low while the FPGA is unconfigured or its banks are unpowered.\n\n2. Source / changes: Copied from FPGA-LDO A V24 (R18 from ASIC CONTROL SAFE IDLE, R20/R22 from ASIC CLOCK AND TOP-CHIP SPI SAFE IDLE; Claude design; refs and part unchanged: 10k 1 % 0402, JLC C25744, read 25 Nov 2026, 07:22 CST); drawn on their plug-pin lines for Carrier V7. Same basis and the same unverified PUDC_B point as the J5 safe-idle box."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 622.3 306.07 0)
