		(uuid "c5096264-c592-5626-82fd-c101c4d6b92d")
	)
	(text_box "1. Function: H5 and H6 are two non-plated M2 holes beside the router plugs for the carrier's holder arm or clamp; the DF40 plugs make only the electrical connection.\n\n2. Source / changes: Howard, 24 Nov 2026, about 16:50 CST (inputs/HOWARD_DECISIONS.md: plugs on a tongue at the XEM8305 MC1 long edge; holder arm/clamp, add two M2 mounting holes beside the plug area); Howard, 25 Nov 2026 (layout V5): the plugs go where the LDO board plugged into Carrier V6, extended out, so the tongue and both holes are now on the west edge at V6 J1 height (y 56.0) with the plugs on the bottom; SYNTHESIS.md section 6 (the carrier needs its own mechanical holder). Footprint: KiCad 10.0.6 stock MountingHole_2.2mm_M2 (2.2 mm NPTH), copied to the project library Carrier_V7_Local; no net. Designed by Claude; the hole positions are set in the layout. Unverified: holder design and hole positions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
